# This Town Ain't Big Enough: "This spell costs {3} less to cast if it targets a permanent you control." With only {U}{U}
# in Bot1's pool, a cast at Bot1's own Ornithopter and Bot2's together (the cost is worked out once the targets are
# chosen, CR 601.2c, 601.2f) costs {1}{U}: the pool is empty right after, and both return to their owners' hands. Bot2's Forest is a land, so it is no legal target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
This Town Ain't Big Enough
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Ornithopter
Forest x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}
Bot1.Hand.This Town Ain't Big Enough.Cast
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Forest)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot2.Hand = Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = This Town Ain't Big Enough
